msgid "Socat"
msgstr "Socat"

msgid "Socat is a powerful bidirectional data relay tool. Configure port forwarding rules below; each rule listens on the given address/port and forwards all traffic to the target address/port."
msgstr "Socat 是一款强大的双向数据中继工具。在下方配置端口转发规则；每条规则在指定的地址/端口上监听，并将所有流量转发到目标地址/端口。"

